    {
      "text": "In the administration hall of Modest Thatched Hut inside Jade Pool blessed land, Dong Fang Chang Fan seats northern plains righteous path Gu Immortals for a deduction transaction and a posthumous alliance with Dong Fang tribe. When Dong Fang Yi Kong reveals a miniature mountain peak for the oath, Murong Qing Si names it Miniscule Mountain first among the guests.",
