    {
      "text": "Like Dong Fang tribe’s Jade Pool, Guan tribe’s Shi Huang, and Hei tribe’s Iron Eagle, Murong tribe’s Yin-Yang blessed land is a main camp pieced together from contributions by various Gu Immortals. Most super forces in the five regions build headquarters that way, with stricter rules when one blessed land swallows another.",
